    "testimonials_QTcD8t": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_fhRDey": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "quote",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "Rola Tassabehji (Yoga Instructor)",
            "text": "<p>As a yoga instructor and lifelong wellness enthusiast, I was drawn to AIWO's offerings, using the latest science-backed deep diagnostics for preventive care. I discovered a number of health issues that needed to be addressed and went unnoticed during my regular annual health check. Thank you AlWO team.</p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_mNFfMr": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "quote",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "Khaled Awad (CEO)",
            "text": "<p>The comprehensive diagnosis at AIWO revealed disappointing facts and identified medical issues which I would have never found with the routine checkups I used to do. Since then, I have been following the holistic treatment philosophy suggested by AIWO and I feel I am on track for the reversal of the diagnosed problems. The empathy and attention I received by all AIWO staff make me feel \"safe\" health wise and in the hands of people who sincerely care about my health.</p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_eRDBAN": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "quote",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "Ayad Tassabehji (General Manager)",
            "text": "<p>The AIWO experience was a true eye opener to the state of my health. The diagnostics and care provided were beyond what I expected, and I especially enjoyed the physio and spa-like services in the comfort of a five star hotel. It felt more like a holiday retreat with lasting benefits.</p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_BczqwB": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "quote",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "Bonno FOK",
            "text": "<p>I had one week program with AIWO. The experience is just amazing. They have all you need. From overall body checks, exercises, massages, recommended foods and drinks. This place is nothing but improving your health, live healthy, live happy and live longer. THANK YOU AIWO.</p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        }
      },
